{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00802","headline":"郊庙歌辞 梁太庙乐舞辞 来仪舞 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 梁太庙乐舞辞 来仪舞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"於赫帝命，应天顺人。\n亭育品汇，宾礼百神。\n洪基永固，景命惟新。\n肃恭孝享，祚我生民。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00802.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00802","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}